{"id": 6174, "group": "campus-dtu-placements", "sent_at": "2026-10-13T13:51:47.565195+00:00", "text": "ICICI DP OA (MNIT) – Overall pattern 👇\n\n1. OA mainly covered MCQs from Python, C/C++, C#, R, SQL/DBMS, Networking and basic programming.\n2. Python questions included tuples, decorators, tokenization, NumPy arrays, OOP and output prediction.\n3. OOP questions covered inheritance, polymorphism, abstract classes and method overriding/hiding.\n4. ML/NLP questions included boosting, weak learners, Latent Semantic Indexing (LSI) and parsing.\n5. Data Science questions covered regression, scatterplots, probability, boxplots and linear algebra.\n6. DBMS questions included deadlock prevention (Wait-Die/Wound-Wait) and DROP INDEX.\n7. Computer Networks questions covered unicast, broadcasting, IP headers, UDP, DNS and DHCP snooping.\n8. Linux/DNS-related questions included hostname and IP lookup commands.\n9. Aptitude questions included train–bridge speed calculations and percentage comparisons.\n10. Agile/Cloud questions covered Scrum, Kanban, PySpark and BigQuery. Overall, prepare broad technical MCQs, code-output questions and basic aptitude rather than focusing on DSA alone.", "author_tag": "IITD", "reply_to": {"id": 5608, "text": "Anyone having icici oa?", "author_tag": "MANI"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
